message: "If you use this code, please cite the manuscript."
title: "Opportunity Structure or Task Structure? School Conditions, Generative AI Use, and Science Literacy in Four Chinese Provinces and Municipalities"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The authors"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-11"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/USERNAME/pisa2025-opportunity-task-structure"
keywords:
  - PISA 2025
  - generative artificial intelligence
  - school effects
  - multilevel modelling
  - science literacy
abstract: >-
  Replication package for a study of whether school conditions moderate the
  association between generative AI use and science literacy, using PISA 2025
  data for 12,385 students in 374 schools in Beijing, Shanghai, Jiangsu and
  Zhejiang. Includes a weighted two-level estimator, the full analysis pipeline,
  result tables, and a 211-item verification of every number in the manuscript.
